WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.410
Give thanks!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.420
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.830
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:25.000
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:48.420
Someone once said:

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:53.220
On a scorching southern island, grass 
of hamburger steak grows wild...

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:57.030
Hambergrass!

00:01:57.830 --> 00:02:04.340
With the fragrant smell of barbecue 
sauce, there are Barbecows!

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:09.940
There's a tree that grows 
never-ending fruits like,

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:11.740
papayas, mangoes, and pineapples...

00:02:11.740 --> 00:02:13.910
The Never-ending Summer Tree!

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:19.980
And the fruit-flavored gelatin 
cicadas which suck on its sap...

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:23.660
Robust Jellycadas!

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:27.830
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:32.500
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:45.840
Knife...

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:49.350
I give thanks for this food...

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:55.050
Nothing better than chocolate 
right after you wake up!

00:02:55.490 --> 00:02:58.490
In one week, the summit of representatives

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:00.630
from IGO member nations 
will be coming to a close.

00:03:01.190 --> 00:03:04.460
However a single person, the President 
Dohem of the Republic of Roto,

00:03:04.460 --> 00:03:06.630
is against the Gourmet Resolution...

00:03:06.630 --> 00:03:11.600
Experts question whether 
the summit can be concluded

00:03:08.570 --> 00:03:10.970
Today it'll be Milk Fruit, I guess.

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:13.540
without the resolution being completed.

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:18.440
It's so delicious when my cocoa 
mug gets melted by the milk!

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:20.280
Awesome!

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:27.620
Now then, time to get some breakfast!

00:03:35.560 --> 00:03:37.230
Yo, Obasaurus!

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:39.060
Yo, Terry!

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:46.870
You haven't eaten anything in almost 2 weeks.

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:57.380
The Taste Written in its DNA! 
Toriko, Search for the BB Corn!

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:09.060
Regal Mammoth, Gourmet Colosseum...

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:11.030
I sure got a lot of great shots.

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:22.540
But the Battle Wolf... The only 
one left of its kind, Terry...

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:28.710
I can't exactly broadcast that, can I?

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:35.450
Since we all worked hard together 
to get that Jewel Meat...

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:41.160
Up against the Gourmet Corp... 
Fighting with everything we had...

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:44.930
And at long last, getting the Jewel Meat...

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:47.800
Even though we all got back safe and sound...

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:54.140
The Jewel Meat gave off so 
much light I couldn't film it.

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:58.210
If my boss finds out I didn't 
get any pictures I can use,

00:04:58.210 --> 00:04:59.940
I'll be in for it big time!

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:02.710
I know!

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:05.980
If I use the bits where 
Terry isn't in the shot...

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:09.920
This is no good...

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:11.690
Ack, he's in this one, too!

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:16.430
Can't use this! No good! Man, 
there isn't a gram I can use!

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:21.670
At this rate, I need to get some 
other super-sized scoop instead!

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:22.970
Rock-paper-scissors!

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:23.940
Yes!

00:05:23.940 --> 00:05:26.740
The Jewel Meat is all 
mine for my Full Course!

00:05:28.310 --> 00:05:30.110
It's been two weeks already...

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:33.280
I wonder how everyone is doing?

00:05:45.090 --> 00:05:47.730
Chef Komatsu is cooking in the restaurant!

00:05:47.730 --> 00:05:49.330
Yes, General Manager!

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:53.500
Just having the chef in the restaurant 
nearly brings me to tears!

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:56.500
If I recall, we had some Parmepepper, yes?

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:57.340
Y-Yes!

00:05:57.340 --> 00:06:00.810
If I take the Cinnamontail I 
got inside the Regal Mammoth,

00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:03.240
and the Parmepepper seeds that combine

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:06.240
the deep flavor of parmesan 
cheese and pepper...

00:06:07.110 --> 00:06:11.080
Then if I season some marbled pork 
from a Marbled Eastern Pig...

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:14.220
Chef, what is that Gourmet Spicer?

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:15.920
I've never seen one like that.

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:19.490
Oh, this is a special Gourmet Spicer.

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:21.360
Actually, I got it from Toriko-san.

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.860
From Gourmet Hunter Toriko?

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:24.130
Wow!

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:26.830
Hard at work I see, Chef Komatsu.

00:06:27.230 --> 00:06:30.130
Bureau Chief Uumen! Johannes-san!

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:36.840
My, this tastes lovely!

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:38.610
Thank you very much.

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:42.980
If you add more spice, it will deepen 
more, and the taste will change.

00:06:42.980 --> 00:06:44.250
Please try it!

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:51.320
Yes, delicious!

00:06:51.320 --> 00:06:56.090
The cheese and pepper, overflowing 
scent of cinnamon... Such impact!

00:06:56.090 --> 00:06:58.230
Truly impactalicious!

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:01.700
So... Does the IGO have some job for me?

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:05.600
Do you know of President Dohem 
of the Republic of Roto,

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:07.410
permanent member of the IGO Security Council?

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:09.340
Dohem...?

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:13.240
You mean the one the GT Robot impersonated?

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:14.150
Yes...

00:07:14.150 --> 00:07:17.220
The Gourmet Corp. took advantage of 
a weakness in the IGO's security,

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:19.820
and switched places with President Dohem.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:25.120
So the President is right angry 
with the IGO's weak security.

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:26.520
I see...

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:30.290
The meeting going on right now 
between the heads of states...

00:07:30.290 --> 00:07:31.700
The Gourmet Summit.

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:34.800
President Dohem, in his stubbornness,

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:37.800
is opposing an important Gourmet 
Resolution all by himself.

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:40.870
And the resolution cannot 
pass until everyone agrees.

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:45.010
In the Republic of Roto 
they think him so obstinate

00:07:45.010 --> 00:07:47.950
the citizens call him 
"Dohem the Don't Budge".

00:07:47.950 --> 00:07:50.580
He is a very difficult man to appease.

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.950
Um... And what is it you want me to...?

00:07:56.920 --> 00:07:58.290
T-This is...

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:00.060
Capture Level 20...

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:03.190
Also known as the Seabottom Princess...

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:04.900
The Mermaituna.

00:08:04.900 --> 00:08:10.170
Its beauty and rarity 
almost like a mermaid...

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:12.970
A fish said to be legendary, the Mermaituna!

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:17.680
We at the IGO Research Department have 
managed to capture one successfully.

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:20.650
The President is a famous gourmand.

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:22.980
And his favorite dish is fatty tuna.

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:27.550
Therefore, Chef, I want you to create 
a dish of the rarest of fatty tuna,

00:08:27.550 --> 00:08:30.790
Bubbly Tuna, from this Mermaituna,

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:32.990
and cure his foul mood.

00:08:33.390 --> 00:08:37.160
Bubbly Tuna... You can only get 
200 grams from a single fish.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:41.500
If I recall, the flavor reaches its 
peak 7 days after being fished...

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:45.440
Yes. And after seven days it cannot be eaten.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:47.740
You have seven days to 
make your preparations.

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:52.840
Chef Komatsu, the success of this 
summit rests on your shoulders!

00:08:53.110 --> 00:08:55.010
You want me to handle 
something this important?!

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:58.650
Don't worry! Your cooking skills 
have improved immensely!

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:00.690
Maybe because of Toriko-chan?

00:09:01.990 --> 00:09:05.260
That might be of help to 
you for this job as well.

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:08.360
Coco-san said the same sort of thing.

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:11.430
Thank you for everything!

00:09:11.430 --> 00:09:15.670
Sure, but what about your job 
at the restaurant, Komatsu-kun?

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:17.140
Aren't you taking a bit too much time off?

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:18.900
Yes... I'm sorry.

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:21.170
You are the Head Chef, after all.

00:09:21.170 --> 00:09:23.510
Maybe you should focus on the restaurant.

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:24.980
Plus, my fortunes tell me

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:28.110
you should hold off on any 
more adventures for a while.

00:09:28.680 --> 00:09:31.980
And one last thing, failures 
are the root of success.

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:33.380
They are the seeds of tomorrow.

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:35.820
Failures will save you.

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:37.920
Uh, sure...

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:40.190
I'm sure that will come in handy.

00:09:40.690 --> 00:09:41.990
Take good care of it, okay?

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:50.840
I sure hope Komatsu-kun heeds my warning...

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:53.940
Coco-sama!

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:56.940
Um, I'm going to head out very soon!

00:09:56.940 --> 00:09:59.810
My Gourmet Fortunes tell me 
when a Beast might appear,

00:09:59.810 --> 00:10:01.680
so I'm going on a Gourmet Hunter journey...

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:04.150
Is everyone listening?

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:05.450
I'm poisonous, you see...

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:20.870
The Growlrus has broken out!

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:27.640
Hey, the Growlrus is out!

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:29.340
It's seriously mad right now!

00:10:30.610 --> 00:10:31.980
Endorphin Smoke!

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:38.950
Sheesh. Be good now.

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:41.550
What were you spacin' out for?

00:10:41.550 --> 00:10:48.490
'Cause that happened with Toriko, and 
I couldn't help remembering it...

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:50.860
What is with you?

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:53.970
Yeah! You're making me 
remember it again, Brother!

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:54.500
I'm about to leave here.

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:58.700
I've recovered all the Rock Drum shells 
that can be made into perfect marble,

00:10:56.070 --> 00:10:58.500
Oh, Toriko...

00:10:58.700 --> 00:11:00.070
so I have no reason to be here anymore.

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:01.910
Where are you going, Brother?

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:06.310
A healing country where they have many 
ingredients and facilities for beauty.

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:08.980
My cuticles took some seriously nasty damage

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:10.920
during my battles with the Gourmet Corp.

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:16.290
It's too bad, but I'll sell all this 
shell, and go get a hair treatment.

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:19.160
While other people are hard 
at work! Takin' it easy?

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:21.060
That was <i>not</i> hard at work.

00:11:21.060 --> 00:11:22.060
Sheesh...

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:26.230
And the Chief's having a relaxing 
drink with Vice President Shigematsu.

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:30.840
This is shochu liqueur made with 
Gararagator, matured for a full 2 years.

00:11:30.840 --> 00:11:33.740
It is 65% percent alcohol.

00:11:37.240 --> 00:11:40.040
A taste like tiger testicles 
that I could get hooked on...

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:42.980
And a slight bitterness of herbs.

00:11:42.980 --> 00:11:44.820
Every pore in my skin opens at once,

00:11:44.820 --> 00:11:47.250
and I feel a warm sensation 
all through my body.

00:11:47.590 --> 00:11:48.220
Tasty!

00:11:49.050 --> 00:11:50.660
However, Shige-san...

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:53.830
I understand why the Vice President 
of the IGO has come here himself...

00:11:53.830 --> 00:11:56.590
But will the Gourmet Corp. really show?

00:11:56.590 --> 00:11:58.160
There is a high probability.

00:11:58.700 --> 00:12:01.430
There's a GT Robot that didn't explode.

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:02.930
They'll come to recover it.

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:05.970
Although I don't know who it'll be.

00:12:05.970 --> 00:12:10.070
In any case, it'll be our jobs this time.

00:12:10.070 --> 00:12:11.380
Yes.

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:15.610
Toriko and the others have done 
plenty in capturing the Jewel Meat.

00:12:20.690 --> 00:12:24.920
Better get some yummy breakfast 
so you can eat up too, Terry.

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:26.760
Terry?

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:48.850
Flyaduck (Avian Beast) Capture Level 15

00:12:48.810 --> 00:12:52.950
A Flyaduck... A fierce flying duck.

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:54.920
But its meat is delicious!

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:58.420
I give thanks for all this 
world's great bounty...

00:12:58.420 --> 00:12:59.990
Let's eat!

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:05.700
Watch out for its attack from the air, Terry!

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:10.770
No reason to rely on you here!

00:13:11.300 --> 00:13:14.210
Three-Fold Spiked Punch!

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:26.750
Now then...

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:28.320
Knife!

00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:46.340
Smells delicious!

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:47.440
Don't you think, Terry?

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:51.310
No good, huh?

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:58.080
I give thanks to all this 
world's great bounty...

00:13:58.080 --> 00:13:59.620
Let's eat.

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:13.300
The lightly flavored duck meat has 
high quality fat running through it,

00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:16.670
like the best quality marbled beef!

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:21.140
And it's a sweet-tasting fat like 
you get with brand-name pork!

00:14:21.140 --> 00:14:23.540
Yum!

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:43.900
Usually, you can't eat bird bones, but 
it's possible to eat the Flyaduck's.

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:48.930
They're crispy and crunchy like potato chips,

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:52.000
and have a texture similar 
to bird cartilage...

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:53.470
Not bad, I say.

00:14:54.270 --> 00:14:57.780
Plus the essence of deep flavors of chicken,

00:14:57.780 --> 00:15:00.950
bouillon, and consomme pour 
out one after another!

00:15:01.680 --> 00:15:02.910
Delicious!

00:15:03.950 --> 00:15:05.880
Thanks for the meal!

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:10.320
I feel like a little after-meal dessert.

00:15:10.820 --> 00:15:14.460
White Apple (Fruit) Capture Level < 1

00:15:12.190 --> 00:15:14.160
White Apples, eh?

00:15:15.290 --> 00:15:16.360
Don't disappoint me...

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:20.330
Ooh, so many!

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:21.570
What a haul!

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:24.540
Terry, is that a Cheese Rabbit?

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:25.840
Nice catch there.

00:15:27.770 --> 00:15:31.680
You're the one who finished 
it off, so you eat it.

00:15:31.680 --> 00:15:36.280
It's for survival, and it's only 
proper respect for its life.

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:48.460
I've got an ingredient that'll liven 
up any dinner table, the Snowyay Crab!

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:50.900
It's one of the top-class ingredients 
you'll find in stock here

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:53.870
at the Gourmet Central 
Market, the World Kitchen!

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:55.070
Bidding starts at 3 million!

00:15:55.070 --> 00:15:56.200
3.3 million!

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:57.740
3.5 million!

00:15:58.400 --> 00:15:59.100
Hey!

00:15:59.100 --> 00:15:59.970
Hey, Toriko!

00:16:00.340 --> 00:16:01.510
Gourmet Hunter Toriko!

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:02.640
In the flesh!

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:05.710
The World Kitchen is 
bustling as always, I see.

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:09.410
Toriko... You haven't been 
bringing things in for a while,

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:11.450
so I'm having trouble making ends meet.

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:13.450
Hey, sorry about that.

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:16.590
Look what I brought to apologize!

00:16:16.590 --> 00:16:18.120
That's a Flyaduck, isn't it?

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:20.430
It's a bit smaller than 
the one I ate, though.

00:16:20.890 --> 00:16:23.360
I'll throw in some White Apples, too.

00:16:23.360 --> 00:16:25.330
Tom-san, I'll buy this!

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:26.960
No, sell it to me!

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:30.370
So, how's that thing I asked you about going?

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:32.170
Did you find any good ingredients?

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:33.600
Not here.

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:34.770
Let's talk tonight.

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:38.280
Figured anything out?

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:39.310
Yeah...

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:43.510
The Battle Wolf originally 
lived in the Gourmet World.

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:47.350
There's a chance the 
reason Terry isn't eating

00:16:47.350 --> 00:16:49.790
is because the food around 
here isn't a good match.

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:53.190
I see. Terry is a clone of a Battle Wolf.

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:59.030
It's possible the taste of the Gourmet 
World ingredients is etched in his DNA.

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:00.400
The Gourmet World...

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:05.000
Everything on the continent 
is called the Gourmet World

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:08.410
except for the Human World, 
the area humans live in.

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:10.110
Unexplored land.

00:17:10.110 --> 00:17:13.080
Said to be a treasure trove of 
yet-undiscovered ingredients.

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:14.810
Way too dangerous...

00:17:14.810 --> 00:17:18.020
A normal human can't even set foot there.

00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:21.090
I guess I'll have to go there before long.

00:17:21.090 --> 00:17:22.520
For Terry, after all.

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:24.360
That might not be necessary.

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:25.160
Oh?

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:26.090
He was here before...

00:17:26.960 --> 00:17:31.960
He brought an ingredient we almost 
never see here to the World Kitchen.

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:35.000
How much will you buy this for?

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:38.040
Yeah, see, I need me some drinking money...

00:17:39.670 --> 00:17:40.670
This is...

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:45.180
An ingredient from the 
Gourmet World, BB Corn.

00:17:45.180 --> 00:17:48.450
The BB Corn that you can make popcorn out of

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:51.820
that was the snack of 
Gourmet Nobles long ago?

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:55.420
This grain is also said to be a 
favorite of Gourmet World Beasts,

00:17:55.420 --> 00:18:00.830
but for some reason there's 
a crop in the Human World.

00:18:02.230 --> 00:18:03.560
Wow...

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:06.300
Even if it is growing in the Human World,

00:18:06.300 --> 00:18:09.870
there ain't many people who 
could get it from there.

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:13.040
Well, not sure about him, though.

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:18.340
That drunk old man has got to 
be the Knocking Master Jiro!

00:18:19.180 --> 00:18:20.850
That legendary Gourmet Hunter?

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:21.810
Yeah.

00:18:21.810 --> 00:18:24.920
It wouldn't surprise me for him 
to capture something like that.

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:30.220
BB Corn... Blue-blood Corn, BB for short.

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:33.060
Incredibly fragrant, with a deep flavor...

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:36.960
If you heat just one kernel with a 
powerful flame until it explodes,

00:18:36.960 --> 00:18:40.100
they say you can make enough 
popcorn for 100 people!

00:18:40.900 --> 00:18:44.170
On the market you could get six 
figures just for one kernel.

00:18:44.170 --> 00:18:48.140
For an entire cob, I wouldn't be surprised 
if you could sell at 1 billion.

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:51.480
Truly the King of Corn!

00:18:51.480 --> 00:18:53.540
Terry might take a liking to it.

00:18:53.540 --> 00:18:55.350
But it's all gone.

00:18:55.850 --> 00:18:59.650
A big trading company came and bought it.

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:02.090
Do you know where the corn grows?

00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:03.090
Yeah...

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:05.520
Far away, 65,000 kilometers to the west.

00:19:06.320 --> 00:19:09.660
The Wu Jungle on the Wool Continent.

00:19:11.030 --> 00:19:15.630
A jungle with carnivorous plants 
that can even devour violent beasts.

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:18.540
A vegetation nightmare...

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:20.410
Hell Plant.

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:23.840
Hell Plant, is it?

00:19:23.840 --> 00:19:26.640
This Wu Jungle sounds right up my alley!

00:19:29.780 --> 00:19:30.850
Oh, if it isn't Komatsu!

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:32.980
What's wrong? Why the long face?

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:34.150
Tom-san!

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:37.220
A sauce to match Bubbly Tuna?

00:19:37.220 --> 00:19:37.920
Yes...

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:40.960
I tried various kinds,

00:19:40.960 --> 00:19:44.230
but the taste of the sauce kept losing 
to the taste of the Bubbly Tuna!

00:19:44.230 --> 00:19:47.430
And the tuna's flavor isn't 
even at its peak yet.

00:19:47.430 --> 00:19:49.600
Some flavor is missing from the sauce...

00:19:49.600 --> 00:19:54.040
I've got to find some key ingredient 
for the sauce... and in five days.

00:19:54.970 --> 00:19:57.510
Komatsu-kun, what perfect timing!

00:19:57.510 --> 00:19:58.810
T-Tina-san?

00:19:58.810 --> 00:20:00.610
Hey, where's Toriko?

00:20:00.610 --> 00:20:01.910
Toriko-san?

00:20:01.910 --> 00:20:03.920
I haven't seen him recently...

00:20:03.920 --> 00:20:08.220
I thought by coming here I could see Toriko 
and get some kind of Gourmet scoop!

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:09.890
But Toriko isn't around at all!

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:11.590
Where did he go?

00:20:11.590 --> 00:20:13.360
I-I don't know!

00:20:13.360 --> 00:20:15.330
If you want Toriko, he's left on a journey.

00:20:15.990 --> 00:20:18.560
Two days ago, for the Wu Jungle.

00:20:19.130 --> 00:20:20.700
That's super far away!

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:21.670
That's it!

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:24.040
I've heard about that...

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:26.740
In the Wu Jungle on the Wool Continent,

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:29.670
there's a seed that's the 
source of a delicious sauce...

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:32.110
Woolstar Sauce seeds!

00:20:32.480 --> 00:20:37.050
With those seeds, I might be able to 
make a sauce to match the Bubbly Tuna!

00:20:37.550 --> 00:20:41.020
I might be able to cook something 
that'll satisfy President Dohem!

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:43.220
Bubbly Tuna?

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:44.290
Dohem?

00:20:44.290 --> 00:20:47.260
I can smell it... I can 
smell a super-sized scoop!

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:51.930
But the Wu Jungle is way too 
dangerous for you two alone.

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:54.100
If we use an extra helping of speed, 
and go there as fast as we can,

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:56.130
we might be able to meet up with Toriko!

00:20:56.130 --> 00:20:56.670
Right!

00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:02.570
You've got to be kidding me!

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:04.210
You called, Komatsu-kun?

00:21:10.550 --> 00:21:13.050
I can't wait to find this BB Corn!

00:21:26.430 --> 00:21:32.570
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:32.570 --> 00:21:39.010
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:39.010 --> 00:21:45.750
Each time I move out, the 
direction of the wind changes.

00:21:45.750 --> 00:21:51.790
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:21:51.790 --> 00:21:55.660
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:21:55.660 --> 00:21:59.100
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:21:59.100 --> 00:22:05.270
on a journey with no end!

00:22:05.270 --> 00:22:08.110
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:22:08.110 --> 00:22:11.610
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:11.680 --> 00:22:17.280
amid the waves of time.

00:22:20.650 --> 00:22:22.290
Gourmet News!

00:22:23.620 --> 00:22:24.890
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:25.390 --> 00:22:28.860
Bubbly Tuna is a section 
of the rare Mermaituna,

00:22:28.860 --> 00:22:32.230
which reaches its peak flavor 7 days 
after the fish is taken from the water.

00:22:32.230 --> 00:22:35.700
It melts with just the slightest 
sense of heat on your tongue,

00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:38.440
and is famous as an ingredient 
that requires special preparation.

00:22:38.440 --> 00:22:40.270
And the Gourmet News has, incredibly,

00:22:40.270 --> 00:22:43.410
gotten our hands on some Bubbly Tuna!

00:22:43.910 --> 00:22:46.210
Let's go right ahead and try some!

00:22:49.080 --> 00:22:50.850
Why'd you make hand-made sushi out of them?!

00:22:50.850 --> 00:22:53.220
They melt just from touching skin, remember?

00:22:53.220 --> 00:22:55.050
They're all melted!

00:22:55.050 --> 00:22:59.290
Shoot... What'll I do for today's broadcast?

00:22:59.960 --> 00:23:01.490
Rice sushi!

00:23:03.130 --> 00:23:04.430
And now, on to the next story!

00:23:07.100 --> 00:23:09.390
Skill is something honed through hardship.

00:23:09.760 --> 00:23:12.370
And now Terry faces his own challenge to overcome!

00:23:12.870 --> 00:23:16.470
The Talent of Battle! Show Me, 
Terry, King in the Making!

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:18.830
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
